519
00:27:03,110 --> 00:27:03,920
Maybe...

520
00:27:03,320 --> 00:27:06,900
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

521
00:27:05,880 --> 00:27:06,640
Maybe something

522
00:27:06,640 --> 00:27:07,640
