523
00:27:07,640 --> 00:27:09,700
What could've happened? A car crash?

524
00:27:10,830 --> 00:27:13,830
"The good speak little;
the impatient speak much."

525
00:27:15,440 --> 00:27:16,570
What does that mean?

526
00:27:17,400 --> 00:27:18,660
It means stop yapping.

527
00:27:22,050 --> 00:27:26,120
[Emergency]

528
00:27:26,140 --> 00:27:29,760
[Emergency Access Route; No Parking]

529
00:27:29,160 --> 00:27:29,880
It's done.

530
00:27:29,760 --> 00:27:33,960
[Emergency Resuscitation]

531
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:30,930
Liu Zhengliang?

532
00:27:31,510 --> 00:27:32,240
Zhengliang!

533
00:27:32,240 --> 00:27:32,720
Yu.

534
00:27:33,400 --> 00:27:34,460
Isn't that Dr. Liu?

535
00:27:43,900 --> 00:27:48,730
[Emergency Access Route; No Parking]

536
00:27:44,310 --> 00:27:45,510
What's going on here?

537
00:27:46,790 --> 00:27:48,120
Lining up to welcome me?

538
00:27:48,550 --> 00:27:49,240
How did you know

539
00:27:49,240 --> 00:27:50,570
I was coming back today?

540
00:27:51,440 --> 00:27:52,550
Latest news:

541
00:27:52,960 --> 00:27:54,590
the people injured in the car accident

542
00:27:54,590 --> 00:27:56,310
were all sent to the Second Hospital.

543
00:27:56,310 --> 00:27:58,880
That was a collective decision
by the injured.

544
00:27:58,880 --> 00:27:59,980
What does that have to do with

545
00:27:59,980 --> 00:28:00,640
what we're talking about?

546
00:28:00,640 --> 00:28:01,640
Of course it does.

547
00:28:03,110 --> 00:28:04,640
The Second Hospital is 7 minutes farther

548
00:28:04,640 --> 00:28:05,510
from the accident scene

549
00:28:05,510 --> 00:28:06,880
than yours is.

550
00:28:06,960 --> 00:28:08,400
The injured would rather

551
00:28:08,510 --> 00:28:10,350
risk an extra 7 minutes

552
00:28:10,350 --> 00:28:11,880
than come to your hospital.

553
00:28:12,270 --> 00:28:13,590
Doesn't that tell you something?

554
00:28:13,590 --> 00:28:14,480
It shows that some people

555
00:28:14,480 --> 00:28:16,410
are biased against this hospital.

556
00:28:16,880 --> 00:28:18,210
We need to correct that.

557
00:28:18,350 --> 00:28:21,070
Your last financial audit showed that
your hospital was suffering serious losses.

558
00:28:21,070 --> 00:28:21,830
Xiaoximen Hospital

559
00:28:21,830 --> 00:28:23,590
has no reason to exist anymore.

560
00:28:23,590 --> 00:28:24,590
That's not

561
00:28:24,590 --> 00:28:25,640
for you to decide.

562
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:27,510
The people of Xiaoximen will decide.

563
00:28:27,510 --> 00:28:28,110
You...

564
00:28:30,750 --> 00:28:33,640
This is necessary to
integrate primary healthcare resources.

565
00:28:33,640 --> 00:28:35,030
I'm here to inform you.

566
00:28:35,270 --> 00:28:36,640
We've already decided:

567
00:28:36,640 --> 00:28:38,640
Xiaoximen Hospital must be closed.

568
00:28:39,790 --> 00:28:40,920
If you're willing,

569
00:28:41,110 --> 00:28:43,640
you can go to the Second Hospital
as a vice president

570
00:28:43,640 --> 00:28:45,030
and coast until retirement.

571
00:28:45,030 --> 00:28:46,160
If not,

572
00:28:46,750 --> 00:28:47,550
you can retire right here and now.

573
00:28:47,550 --> 00:28:48,640
Suit yourself.

574
00:28:55,030 --> 00:28:56,350
You can't just
close the hospital like that!

575
00:28:56,350 --> 00:28:59,070
How am I supposed to
explain this to everyone here?

576
00:28:59,070 --> 00:29:00,790
There's no room for negotiation!

577
00:29:00,790 --> 00:29:02,240
Stop fighting it, Long!

578
00:29:05,050 --> 00:29:09,480
[Decision-Making Procedure for
"Three Major and One Important" Matters]

579
00:29:18,000 --> 00:29:20,320
[Decision-Making Procedure for
"Three Major and One Important" Matters]

580
00:29:26,480 --> 00:29:27,680
No one can come in now.

581
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:29,310
President...

582
00:29:29,310 --> 00:29:30,270
Don't speak yet.

583
00:29:39,070 --> 00:29:40,160
What the heck?

584
00:29:40,200 --> 00:29:40,960
The hospital's about to be closed,

585
00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:42,290
and you can still laugh?

586
00:29:43,000 --> 00:29:44,800
Those are two different things.

587
00:29:54,240 --> 00:29:55,350
About...

588
00:29:56,590 --> 00:29:59,000
A-About what happened in Fuzhou,

589
00:29:59,510 --> 00:30:01,240
I really didn't know anything.

590
00:30:01,270 --> 00:30:03,200
I called to ask about it afterward.

591
00:30:03,790 --> 00:30:05,110
You were just unlucky.

592
00:30:05,550 --> 00:30:07,830
If you'd arrived 2 days earlier
and joined,

593
00:30:07,830 --> 00:30:08,620
Hong Bin's trouble

594
00:30:08,620 --> 00:30:10,220
wouldn't have affected you.

595
00:30:14,160 --> 00:30:15,360
You don't believe me?

596
00:30:16,230 --> 00:30:18,400
I do. How could I not?

597
00:30:21,590 --> 00:30:22,400
Thank you.

598
00:30:23,350 --> 00:30:25,810
Thank you for everything
you've done for me.

599
00:30:25,920 --> 00:30:26,830
You being so polite all of a sudden

600
00:30:26,830 --> 00:30:28,490
makes me very uncomfortable.

601
00:30:28,720 --> 00:30:30,400
I went away for a while.

602
00:30:30,480 --> 00:30:32,610
Thought I'd come back with a new style.

603
00:30:32,720 --> 00:30:33,880
What? You got into trouble?

604
00:30:33,880 --> 00:30:34,590
Nothing.

605
00:30:34,640 --> 00:30:36,240
What trouble could there be?

606
00:30:38,310 --> 00:30:41,110
Didn't you say
you'd rather starve than come back?

607
00:30:41,270 --> 00:30:43,350
It's not that I couldn't
find a good job elsewhere!

608
00:30:43,350 --> 00:30:44,480
I just feel this lousy place

609
00:30:44,480 --> 00:30:45,440
needs me more.

610
00:30:56,160 --> 00:30:58,560
Xiaoximen Hospital is
on its last legs too.

611
00:31:09,510 --> 00:31:10,110
Doctor,

612
00:31:10,350 --> 00:31:12,110
I was working at a construction site

613
00:31:12,110 --> 00:31:13,510
and fell, hurting my leg.

614
00:31:13,510 --> 00:31:14,970
Come on, let me take a look.

615
00:31:20,700 --> 00:31:22,320
[Nurses' Station]

616
00:31:21,240 --> 00:31:22,240
Come on, sit here.

617
00:31:22,680 --> 00:31:27,630
[Yellow Zone]

618
00:31:25,510 --> 00:31:26,310
Be careful.

619
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:30,540
[Nurses' Station]

620
00:31:34,160 --> 00:31:34,830
You have...

621
00:31:35,030 --> 00:31:36,240
a laceration on your right calf,

622
00:31:36,240 --> 00:31:37,640
and it's still bleeding.

623
00:31:38,310 --> 00:31:39,960
I thought I'd treat it myself,

624
00:31:39,460 --> 00:31:47,660
[Yellow Zone]

625
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:41,800
but it just won't stop bleeding.

626
00:31:41,830 --> 00:31:42,550
Come on.

627
00:31:42,550 --> 00:31:43,240
With a gash this big,

628
00:31:43,240 --> 00:31:44,790
how can you treat it yourself?

629
00:31:44,790 --> 00:31:45,790
You need stitches.

630
00:31:45,790 --> 00:31:46,640
Go register.

631
00:31:47,590 --> 00:31:49,350
Well, I don't have my ID card with me.

632
00:31:47,660 --> 00:31:51,160
[Nurses' Station]

633
00:31:49,590 --> 00:31:51,250
My family is bringing it over.

634
00:31:51,400 --> 00:31:53,790
Can the doctor stitch me up first?

635
00:31:54,070 --> 00:31:55,330
You don't have your ID?

636
00:31:56,680 --> 00:31:57,480
Then do this.

637
00:31:57,480 --> 00:31:58,030
Get a blank registration form

638
00:31:58,030 --> 00:31:59,590
from the registration window.

639
00:31:59,590 --> 00:32:00,440
Pay the fee,

640
00:32:00,440 --> 00:32:01,680
and I'll have the doctor treat you first.

641
00:32:01,680 --> 00:32:02,830
Come find me after you've been treated.

642
00:32:02,830 --> 00:32:03,480
Okay.

643
00:32:03,680 --> 00:32:04,480
Be careful.

644
00:32:04,510 --> 00:32:05,310
I'll go find you a doctor.

645
00:32:05,310 --> 00:32:05,960
Okay.

646
00:32:07,720 --> 00:32:08,510
You really didn't know Zhengliang

647
00:32:08,510 --> 00:32:09,440
was coming back?

648
00:32:09,440 --> 00:32:10,160
I swear, I was just as surprised

649
00:32:10,160 --> 00:32:11,000
as you guys.

650
00:32:11,000 --> 00:32:12,070
I only found out

651
00:32:12,070 --> 00:32:13,160
when I saw him.

652
00:32:13,160 --> 00:32:14,960
Who? Talking about Zhengliang?

653
00:32:15,240 --> 00:32:16,230
I saw it coming!

654
00:32:16,750 --> 00:32:17,720
Oh, come on.

655
00:32:17,720 --> 00:32:18,830
Who was it that so firmly said

656
00:32:18,830 --> 00:32:19,640
he'd never come back,

657
00:32:19,640 --> 00:32:22,030
and even that he was
completely heartbroken?

658
00:32:22,030 --> 00:32:23,270
I-I just forgot

659
00:32:23,270 --> 00:32:25,240
that Zhengliang is different from others.

660
00:32:25,240 --> 00:32:26,070
Some people just

661
00:32:26,070 --> 00:32:27,510
run away when their hearts are broken.

662
00:32:27,510 --> 00:32:28,550
But Zhengliang?

663
00:32:28,550 --> 00:32:30,440
He can come back and sew his heart up.

664
00:32:30,440 --> 00:32:31,440
How does he sew it?

665
00:32:33,310 --> 00:32:34,920
There's a patient outside
with a laceration on his leg.

666
00:32:34,920 --> 00:32:36,240
Then he needs stitches.

667
00:32:36,240 --> 00:32:37,110
The bleeding is under control.

668
00:32:37,110 --> 00:32:38,710
Who's going to stitch him up?

669
00:32:40,510 --> 00:32:41,310
I'll do it.

670
00:32:42,310 --> 00:32:43,000
Let me do this. Let me.

671
00:32:43,000 --> 00:32:43,640
This way.

672
00:32:44,400 --> 00:32:45,200
Hurry, hurry.

673
00:32:47,000 --> 00:32:48,240
The good old days are back.

674
00:32:48,240 --> 00:32:50,310
Um, these photos are from security.

675
00:32:50,640 --> 00:32:51,480
Every doctor is required

676
00:32:51,480 --> 00:32:52,880
to take a look at the man in them.

677
00:32:52,880 --> 00:32:53,480
Here.

678
00:32:53,880 --> 00:32:54,350
Here you go.

679
00:32:54,350 --> 00:32:56,830
Okay, okay, okay.

680
00:32:57,490 --> 00:33:02,540
[Du Fang]

681
00:32:58,960 --> 00:33:00,240
He looks quite sharp.

682
00:33:00,400 --> 00:33:02,260
I can tell at a glance he's no good.

683
00:33:06,590 --> 00:33:07,920
What are you staring at?

684
00:33:09,920 --> 00:33:12,070
I'm waiting for my family
to bring my ID card over.

685
00:33:12,070 --> 00:33:13,440
Don't worry.

686
00:33:13,480 --> 00:33:15,070
I'll stitch you up first.

687
00:33:15,640 --> 00:33:18,270
Then I'll give you a tetanus shot.

688
00:33:18,960 --> 00:33:19,830
Just to be safe.

689
00:33:20,750 --> 00:33:21,950
Stitches are enough.

690
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:23,420
No need for a tetanus shot.

691
00:33:24,550 --> 00:33:25,270
This is a hospital.

692
00:33:25,270 --> 00:33:27,070
Who's the doctor here, you or me?

693
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:35,720
[Employment Contract]

694
00:33:45,630 --> 00:33:49,360
[Party B (Signature): Liu Zhengliang]

695
00:34:05,400 --> 00:34:07,460
Welcome back to Xiaoximen Hospital.

696
00:34:07,790 --> 00:34:08,719
President Long,

697
00:34:08,920 --> 00:34:10,230
when can I start work?

698
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:12,880
Dr. Liu,

699
00:34:13,230 --> 00:34:14,630
whenever you're ready.

700
00:34:14,670 --> 00:34:15,360
Okay.

701
00:34:15,480 --> 00:34:17,210
Then I'll go let everyone know.

702
00:34:20,840 --> 00:34:21,639
Wait a minute.

703
00:34:21,960 --> 00:34:24,290
There's something I need to return to you.

704
00:34:32,920 --> 00:34:39,130
[Miracle Worker; Zhang Dexu & Dou Liping]

705
00:34:43,590 --> 00:34:45,650
Zhang Jiao was discharged last week.

706
00:34:48,400 --> 00:34:49,530
She can speak again?

707
00:34:52,030 --> 00:34:52,840
The thank-you banner wasn't

708
00:34:52,840 --> 00:34:54,639
delivered until after you left.

709
00:34:56,150 --> 00:34:58,150
Now it's back to its rightful owner.

710
00:35:02,190 --> 00:35:03,990
This is the best news I've gotten

711
00:35:04,710 --> 00:35:05,840
since coming back.

712
00:35:08,190 --> 00:35:09,720
Take a look at this, Junnan.

713
00:35:10,280 --> 00:35:11,360
There was, um,

714
00:35:11,400 --> 00:35:12,400
a car accident

715
00:35:12,400 --> 00:35:13,260
on the highway—

716
00:35:13,360 --> 00:35:14,110
a pile-up.

717
00:35:14,110 --> 00:35:15,400
And one of the vehicles was a police van

718
00:35:15,400 --> 00:35:16,710
transporting prisoners.

719
00:35:16,710 --> 00:35:17,920
T-Two police officers

720
00:35:17,920 --> 00:35:19,670
and three prisoners were all injured.

721
00:35:19,670 --> 00:35:21,030
And the prisoners escaped right afterward.

722
00:35:21,030 --> 00:35:21,840
Security has circulated pictures

723
00:35:21,840 --> 00:35:23,110
for everyone to see.

724
00:35:23,400 --> 00:35:24,480
They probably took a detour and ran away.

725
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:25,960
They wouldn't come to Xiaoximen.

726
00:35:25,960 --> 00:35:27,110
The police already have.

727
00:35:27,110 --> 00:35:28,710
They're at our entrance.

728
00:35:29,030 --> 00:35:30,110
There are police stationed at

729
00:35:30,110 --> 00:35:31,240
every hospital now.

730
00:35:31,320 --> 00:35:32,190
Someone said...

731
00:35:32,190 --> 00:35:33,400
said that whoever spots the fugitives

732
00:35:33,400 --> 00:35:34,960
will get a 5,000 yuan reward.

733
00:35:34,960 --> 00:35:36,190
Who'd want t-that money?

734
00:35:36,190 --> 00:35:37,030
A 5,000 yuan reward?

735
00:35:37,030 --> 00:35:38,150
Then I'd better take a good look.

736
00:35:38,150 --> 00:35:38,800
No way.

737
00:35:38,800 --> 00:35:40,280
T-They'd better not come to our hospital.

738
00:35:40,280 --> 00:35:42,070
It'd be a mess if they did.

739
00:35:54,840 --> 00:35:55,760
No, no, no!

740
00:35:55,920 --> 00:35:56,510
Don't yell.

741
00:35:56,510 --> 00:35:57,000
Bro!

742
00:35:57,000 --> 00:35:57,550
You hear me?

743
00:35:57,550 --> 00:35:58,280
W-We won't yell!

744
00:35:58,280 --> 00:35:59,400
Make one more noise,
and I'll stab you both!

745
00:35:59,400 --> 00:35:59,840
Do you hear me?

746
00:35:59,840 --> 00:36:00,480
No, no, no.

747
00:36:00,390 --> 00:36:03,330
[Supply Room]

748
00:36:01,110 --> 00:36:01,760
Um...

749
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:03,400
Bro.

750
00:36:03,400 --> 00:36:04,030
Don't say a word.

751
00:36:04,030 --> 00:36:05,230
Okay, okay, we won't.

752
00:36:05,760 --> 00:36:06,360
Bro.

753
00:36:09,590 --> 00:36:10,480
A fugitive has come to our hospital.

754
00:36:10,480 --> 00:36:11,760
-Call security! Call security!
-He's come to our hospital!

755
00:36:11,760 --> 00:36:13,620
Call the police! Call the police!

756
00:36:13,760 --> 00:36:15,190
Stay clear of him! Stay clear of him!

757
00:36:14,530 --> 00:36:14,820
[Quiet]

758
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:16,570
[Quiet]

759
00:36:15,400 --> 00:36:16,600
He's in our hospital!

760
00:36:16,630 --> 00:36:17,760
Get out of the way!

761
00:36:18,880 --> 00:36:19,840
Stay clear of him! Out of his way!

762
00:36:19,840 --> 00:36:20,770
He's got a knife!

763
00:36:21,150 --> 00:36:22,550
Quick, hide! Hide!

764
00:36:22,800 --> 00:36:23,800
Hide! Quick, hide!

765
00:36:22,910 --> 00:36:24,940
[Stroke Center; Green Channel]

766
00:36:25,630 --> 00:36:26,690
What are you doing?

767
00:36:28,280 --> 00:36:28,760
Quick!

768
00:36:30,230 --> 00:36:31,030
Police!

769
00:36:31,110 --> 00:36:32,000
He's got a knife!

770
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:32,920
Get the...

771
00:36:32,470 --> 00:36:34,090
[Police]

772
00:36:35,030 --> 00:36:35,960
Police! Freeze!

773
00:36:36,440 --> 00:36:38,030
Get all the patients
and medical staff out of the way!

774
00:36:37,270 --> 00:36:40,430
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

775
00:36:38,110 --> 00:36:39,040
He's got a knife!

776
00:36:39,710 --> 00:36:41,670
He's got a knife! He's got a knife!

777
00:36:41,670 --> 00:36:42,280
Du Fang!

778
00:36:42,280 --> 00:36:42,800
Freeze!

779
00:36:43,590 --> 00:36:44,550
He's got a knife!

780
00:36:47,880 --> 00:36:49,400
Du Fang! Freeze!

781
00:36:58,400 --> 00:36:59,480
Du Fang, stop right there!

782
00:36:59,480 --> 00:37:00,150
Freeze!

783
00:37:02,360 --> 00:37:03,020
Don't move!

784
00:37:03,230 --> 00:37:04,110
Nobody move!

785
00:37:04,480 --> 00:37:05,110
Calm down!

786
00:37:05,590 --> 00:37:06,630
Put the knife down!

787
00:37:06,630 --> 00:37:07,550
Sir! Sir!

788
00:37:07,800 --> 00:37:08,800
Violence against healthcare workers
is illegal!

789
00:37:08,800 --> 00:37:09,800
Take it up with whoever wronged you.

790
00:37:09,800 --> 00:37:10,670
I-I'm a good doctor.

791
00:37:10,670 --> 00:37:12,270
Look, me, "Miracle Worker."

792
00:37:12,280 --> 00:37:13,710
Say another word, and I'll kill you!

793
00:37:13,710 --> 00:37:14,760
Put the knife down.

794
00:37:14,760 --> 00:37:16,070
-Put it down.
-Put it down!

795
00:37:16,070 --> 00:37:17,280
You can't escape now!

796
00:37:17,230 --> 00:37:18,320
[Riot Control]

797
00:37:17,360 --> 00:37:18,420
Put the knife down!

798
00:37:18,420 --> 00:37:21,450
[Surgical Inpatient Department]

799
00:37:18,550 --> 00:37:19,320
Everyone else, stay back!

800
00:37:19,320 --> 00:37:20,150
Don't come closer!

801
00:37:20,150 --> 00:37:21,350
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

802
00:37:22,960 --> 00:37:24,670
Du Fang, you can't escape!

803
00:37:24,520 --> 00:37:26,980
[Inpatient Unit] [Nurses' Station]

804
00:37:24,800 --> 00:37:25,860
Put the knife down!

805
00:37:26,280 --> 00:37:27,610
I'm not going to prison!

806
00:37:27,840 --> 00:37:29,110
I didn't do anything!

807
00:37:29,280 --> 00:37:30,590
I'm innocent!

808
00:37:31,750 --> 00:37:32,550
Step back!

809
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:33,920
All of you, step back!

810
00:37:33,920 --> 00:37:34,670
Step back!

811
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:36,470
[Riot Control]

812
00:37:34,670 --> 00:37:36,000
Bystanders, stay back!

813
00:37:36,440 --> 00:37:37,840
Think about your family!

814
00:37:38,280 --> 00:37:39,630
I have no family left!

815
00:37:40,190 --> 00:37:41,710
Come any closer, and I'll kill him!

816
00:37:41,710 --> 00:37:42,230
Put it down! Put it down!

817
00:37:42,230 --> 00:37:43,030
Don't, don't, don't!

818
00:37:43,030 --> 00:37:44,000
All of you, back off!

819
00:37:44,000 --> 00:37:45,030
Du Fang, calm down!

820
00:37:45,030 --> 00:37:45,840
Calm down!

821
00:37:45,840 --> 00:37:46,760
We can talk this out!

822
00:37:46,760 --> 00:37:47,280
Step back!

823
00:37:47,280 --> 00:37:47,750
[Police]

824
00:37:47,780 --> 00:37:48,160
[Police]

825
00:37:48,220 --> 00:37:48,380
[Police]

826
00:37:48,450 --> 00:37:48,760
[Police]

827
00:37:48,820 --> 00:37:49,120
[Police]

828
00:37:49,160 --> 00:37:50,050
[West Gate]

829
00:37:50,050 --> 00:37:52,050
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

830
00:37:51,510 --> 00:37:53,070
Du Fang, put the knife down!

831
00:37:58,230 --> 00:37:59,030
Freeze!

832
00:38:00,150 --> 00:38:00,960
Du Fang.

833
00:38:01,760 --> 00:38:02,960
You can't escape now!

834
00:38:03,920 --> 00:38:05,150
You've only been sentenced to 2 years.

835
00:38:04,200 --> 00:38:07,050
[Riot Control]

836
00:38:05,550 --> 00:38:06,400
Why take things

837
00:38:06,400 --> 00:38:07,150
to this extreme?

838
00:38:07,150 --> 00:38:09,410
I don't want to
spend a single day in jail!

839
00:38:10,400 --> 00:38:12,030
I'm really innocent!

840
00:38:12,280 --> 00:38:14,280
You assaulted your boss
and caused minor injuries.

841
00:38:14,280 --> 00:38:15,230
The facts are clear!

842
00:38:15,230 --> 00:38:16,000
Nonsense!

843
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:19,550
Growing up,
whenever I saw people fighting,

844
00:38:19,550 --> 00:38:20,950
I always stayed far away.

845
00:38:21,190 --> 00:38:23,250
How could I possibly have hit anyone?

846
00:38:24,110 --> 00:38:25,710
The law is all about evidence.

847
00:38:25,710 --> 00:38:27,400
It's not about what you say.

848
00:38:29,150 --> 00:38:30,710
What freaking evidence?

849
00:38:31,550 --> 00:38:32,840
It's all fake!

850
00:38:33,110 --> 00:38:33,920
Calm down.

851
00:38:34,150 --> 00:38:35,510
-Calm down.
-Put your gun down!

852
00:38:35,510 --> 00:38:37,110
You put the knife down first...

853
00:38:35,590 --> 00:38:40,440
[Riot Control]

854
00:38:37,110 --> 00:38:38,400
Well, bro!

855
00:38:38,400 --> 00:38:39,320
Bro, calm down.

856
00:38:39,320 --> 00:38:40,360
C-Can I say something?

857
00:38:40,360 --> 00:38:41,150
L-Look, you see,

858
00:38:41,150 --> 00:38:42,000
you came to our hospital,

859
00:38:42,000 --> 00:38:43,510
and we stitched up your wounds

860
00:38:43,510 --> 00:38:44,360
and bandaged you.

861
00:38:44,360 --> 00:38:45,510
Nobody here has tried to hurt you.

862
00:38:45,510 --> 00:38:46,230
You know?

863
00:38:46,230 --> 00:38:48,440
He didn't do anything to you.

864
00:38:48,440 --> 00:38:49,550
And you're treating him like this...

865
00:38:49,550 --> 00:38:51,000
Y-You are both young.

866
00:38:51,000 --> 00:38:52,930
It's not easy for anyone, you know?

867
00:38:53,070 --> 00:38:54,400
I-I am the president.

868
00:38:55,320 --> 00:38:56,510
H-How about I take his place?

869
00:38:56,510 --> 00:38:57,550
Huang! Huang!

870
00:38:58,190 --> 00:38:58,840
Huang!

871
00:38:59,000 --> 00:38:59,960
There are police! The police are here!

872
00:38:59,960 --> 00:39:00,960
The police are here.

873
00:39:00,340 --> 00:39:03,860
[Riot Control]

874
00:39:01,880 --> 00:39:02,670
Du Fang.

875
00:39:03,030 --> 00:39:03,960
Trust me.

876
00:39:04,510 --> 00:39:05,280
We'll definitely ask the judge

877
00:39:05,280 --> 00:39:06,550
to be lenient with you.

878
00:39:07,670 --> 00:39:09,320
You're all lying to me.

879
00:39:10,400 --> 00:39:11,800
Not one of you is sincere!

880
00:39:11,800 --> 00:39:13,030
You're all liars!

881
00:39:35,510 --> 00:39:36,550
What's going on? What happened?

882
00:39:36,270 --> 00:39:40,620
[Neurosurgery Inpatient Unit]

883
00:39:36,550 --> 00:39:37,880
W-What's going on?

884
00:39:44,880 --> 00:39:46,140
Let us check your neck.

885
00:40:01,840 --> 00:40:02,800
We can still save him.

886
00:40:02,800 --> 00:40:03,630
Get him to the ER!

887
00:40:03,630 --> 00:40:03,920
Quick, quick!

888
00:40:03,920 --> 00:40:04,550
Crash cart!

889
00:40:04,550 --> 00:40:05,320
Crash cart!

890
00:40:05,480 --> 00:40:06,030
Hurry!

891
00:40:13,110 --> 00:40:14,190
Imaging shows

892
00:40:14,190 --> 00:40:16,110
the bullet passed through
the right side of the skull,

893
00:40:16,110 --> 00:40:18,030
involving the temporal
and occipital bones.

894
00:40:18,030 --> 00:40:19,920
About... a dozen bone fragments.

895
00:40:20,150 --> 00:40:20,920
Cerebral contusion and laceration

896
00:40:20,920 --> 00:40:22,780
with an intracerebral hematoma.

897
00:40:22,840 --> 00:40:23,800
The midline structures
are significantly compressed

898
00:40:23,800 --> 00:40:25,110
and shifted to the left.

899
00:40:25,110 --> 00:40:28,170
Fortunately, there is no damage
to the deep brainstem.

900
00:40:30,070 --> 00:40:31,280
We'll perform a craniotomy immediately

901
00:40:31,280 --> 00:40:32,150
to evacuate the hematoma

902
00:40:32,150 --> 00:40:35,150
and remove any foreign bodies
remaining in the skull.

903
00:40:35,320 --> 00:40:36,070
Zhengliang,

904
00:40:36,480 --> 00:40:38,280
look at his right temporal area.

905
00:40:39,280 --> 00:40:40,030
The density there

906
00:40:40,030 --> 00:40:41,230
really isn't right.

907
00:40:41,550 --> 00:40:44,010
There seems to be
a space-occupying lesion.

908
00:40:46,150 --> 00:40:47,610
Let's save his life first.

909
00:40:47,760 --> 00:40:49,630
We can confirm it
while evacuating the hematoma.

910
00:40:49,630 --> 00:40:49,880
Okay.

911
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:53,280
Alright. Let's start
debriding and disinfecting the wound.

912
00:40:59,190 --> 00:41:00,190
Bipolar forceps.

913
00:41:19,840 --> 00:41:20,480
Here.

914
00:41:22,630 --> 00:41:23,960
Evacuate the hematoma.

915
00:41:25,440 --> 00:41:26,070
Scalpel.

916
00:41:26,480 --> 00:41:27,030
Scalpel.

917
00:41:30,800 --> 00:41:31,930
Forceps, scissors.

918
00:41:34,000 --> 00:41:36,260
Give me the bipolar forceps and suction.

919
00:41:37,230 --> 00:41:37,880
Mingming,

920
00:41:37,880 --> 00:41:38,960
get the microsurgical scissors ready.

921
00:41:38,960 --> 00:41:41,000
Be prepared to
cut any blood vessels I cauterize.

922
00:41:41,000 --> 00:41:41,480
Okay.

923
00:41:41,550 --> 00:41:42,070
Junnan.

924
00:41:42,230 --> 00:41:44,760
Irrigate the surgical field intermittently

925
00:41:45,030 --> 00:41:47,030
and keep the cerebral cortex moist.

926
00:41:47,150 --> 00:41:47,840
Got it.

927
00:41:47,920 --> 00:41:48,920
Alright, cut.

928
00:41:50,320 --> 00:41:51,380
Hemostatic gauze.

929
00:41:51,480 --> 00:41:52,610
And gelatin sponge.

930
00:42:01,460 --> 00:42:02,090
Why didn't you tell me in advance

931
00:42:02,090 --> 00:42:03,680
that you were coming back?

932
00:42:04,840 --> 00:42:07,030
It all happened so suddenly.
There was no time to tell you.

933
00:42:07,030 --> 00:42:09,090
Didn't you say you'd never come back?

934
00:42:09,320 --> 00:42:10,710
Are you trying to ease your nerves

935
00:42:10,710 --> 00:42:11,910
by making small talk?

936
00:42:15,030 --> 00:42:16,150
I'm not nervous.

937
00:42:16,960 --> 00:42:17,800
What makes me nervous is

938
00:42:17,800 --> 00:42:19,590
that he almost killed you.

939
00:42:19,920 --> 00:42:20,710
Look at your wound.

940
00:42:20,710 --> 00:42:22,240
Another half a centimeter,

941
00:42:22,440 --> 00:42:24,110
and the consequences
would have been unthinkable.

942
00:42:24,110 --> 00:42:25,960
So you think he's a bad guy,

943
00:42:26,920 --> 00:42:29,520
and it doesn't matter
whether he lives or dies?

944
00:42:34,190 --> 00:42:35,850
I feel much less stressed now.

945
00:42:36,360 --> 00:42:37,490
What about you guys?

946
00:42:50,760 --> 00:42:52,670
Okay, I get it.

947
00:42:52,880 --> 00:42:54,140
In the operating room,

948
00:42:54,510 --> 00:42:56,240
there are no good or bad people,

949
00:42:56,400 --> 00:42:57,510
only patients.

950
00:43:00,400 --> 00:43:01,400
Be professional.

951
00:43:03,710 --> 00:43:05,070
The hematoma is almost cleared.

952
00:43:05,070 --> 00:43:06,710
That space-occupying lesion we saw

953
00:43:06,710 --> 00:43:07,920
on the scan earlier—

954
00:43:08,070 --> 00:43:08,760
is it here?

955
00:43:09,590 --> 00:43:10,450
Yes, it's here.

956
00:43:11,230 --> 00:43:13,000
Take a tissue sample for pathology.
